		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4678&amp;p=34773#p34773"><![CDATA[
Greetings to you! Thank you for the great work you have done. Well, I would like to ask: will there be a continuation in this development on the use of large fonts? I think that you can also increase the width a little (tentatively), because the color screens of the new radio stations allow you to do this. Yes, it will not fit 16-20 characters, but practice shows that this is enough. In the end, you can try, if users don't like it, then it won't take long to curtail this development. But you still need to try. I talk to a lot of people, many have been looking for enlarged fonts for your firmware for a long time, so in my opinion it is very in demand. Thank you for your work!!!<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6146">r1zdn</a> — Wed Dec 18, 2024 4:43 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
