I would like to take advantage of this moment and congratulate you. Because you are incredible.<br>Still on December 12th, I read the suggestions about the idea of ??being able to change the font in the prompt.<br>It was a pointer that I was going to make.<br>And 3 days later you already implemented the suggestion.<br>I'm a QA, and I know how complex some changes are.<br><br>I suggest it to be "Text Font": With the options "1pt and 2pt", or "Major and Minor", or "Big and Small".<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7318">PW8GDC</a> — Mon Dec 16, 2024 2:44 pm</p><hr />
